---
id: STR-001
title: 每集恰好 1 个 Hook Beat 且位于前 20%
domain: structure
severity: block
stage: after_p3
select: "episodes[*]"
bind:
  hooks: "beats[?beat_kind=='hook']"
  total: "length(beats)"
assert: "count(hooks) == 1 and hooks[0].order <= max(1, int(total * 0.2))"
message: "第 {item.no} 集的 Hook Beat 数量={count(hooks)}、位置={hooks[0].order if hooks else 'N/A'}（共 {total} 个 Beat）。短视频账号的短剧前 3 秒决定去留，Hook 必须是全集第一个或第二个 Beat 且只能有一个焦点。请把开场收敛为单一悬念。"
fix_hint: "把非首位的 hook 降级为 escalation，或把真正的钩子提到 order=0。"
tags: [hook, retention]
---
id: STR-002
title: 每集必须有终态 Beat（cliffhanger 或 resolution）
domain: structure
severity: block
stage: after_p3
select: "episodes[*]"
bind:
  last: "beats[-1]"
assert: "last.beat_kind in ['cliffhanger','resolution','cta']"
message: "第 {item.no} 集最后一个 Beat 是 {last.beat_kind}，不是终态 Beat。观众在集末需要一个明确的'钩住'或'满足'，否则不会点下一集。请把末 Beat 改为 cliffhanger（非末集）或 resolution/cta（末集）。"
tags: [structure]
---
id: STR-003
title: Beat 数落在 Profile 区间内
domain: structure
severity: block
stage: after_p3
select: "episodes[*]"
bind:
  lo: "@.__ctx.profile.beats_per_episode[0]"
  hi: "@.__ctx.profile.beats_per_episode[1]"
assert: "lo <= length(item.beats) <= hi"
message: "第 {item.no} 集有 {count(item.beats)} 个 Beat，Profile 要求 {lo}–{hi} 个。Beat 过少会导致节奏拖沓、单个 Beat 撑不满时长；过多会导致每个 Beat 只有几秒、观众跟不上。"
tags: [pacing]
---
